:::text id=WtG2BqfbOq at=top-left width=1080 height=80 offsetX=100 offsetY=40 preset=title align=center color=text
# Known Bugs & Support Strategies
:::

:::shape id=b1_card at=top-left width=520 height=230 offsetX=100 offsetY=150 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16 shadow=md
:::

:::text id=-_fQGtW_LY at=top-left width=480 height=190 offsetX=120 offsetY=170 preset=body align=left color=text
**BUG 01: Asking too many questions upfront**  
*Support:* Provide clear context upfront and explain relevance to business or team goals.
:::

:::shape id=b2_card at=top-left width=520 height=230 offsetX=660 offsetY=150 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16 shadow=md
:::

:::text id=6oHlgNrGuz at=top-left width=480 height=190 offsetX=680 offsetY=170 preset=body align=left color=text
**BUG 02: Slow response on low energy**  
*Support:* Give time to recover; feel free to call out if something is truly urgent.
:::

:::shape id=b3_card at=top-left width=520 height=230 offsetX=100 offsetY=410 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16 shadow=md
:::

:::text id=s_1W74oPFQ at=top-left width=480 height=190 offsetX=120 offsetY=430 preset=body align=left color=text
**BUG 03: Incoherent when over-excited**  
*Support:* Pause, give time for ideas to sink in, and echo back what you heard.
:::

:::shape id=b4_card at=top-left width=520 height=230 offsetX=660 offsetY=410 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16 shadow=md
:::

:::text id=Uot7lQpCsO at=top-left width=480 height=190 offsetX=680 offsetY=430 preset=body align=left color=text
**BUG 04: Pushing self & team too hard**  
*Support:* Speak up if it's ineffective or if energy is better redirected elsewhere.
:::
